{
  "_comment": [
    "The City has renamed service areas, departments, spending categories and",
    "funds several times between FY2011 and FY2027. The published open data keeps",
    "whatever label was in use that year, so a naive year-over-year comparison",
    "shows the same department twice - once ending and once starting - instead of",
    "one continuous line.",
    "",
    "This file classifies exact label mappings. Deliberate renames and",
    "organizational crosswalks preserve the published field and populate a",
    "parallel *_comparison field. Typo/format corrections clean the published",
    "field directly. The canonical name is generally the FY2027 spelling.",
    "",
    "The build script reports any label that does not appear in every fiscal year",
    "and is not listed here, so future renames get noticed rather than silently",
    "producing a broken comparison.",
    "",
    "Format: field -> { historical label: comparison or corrected label }.",
    "Mappings listed in _ruleTypes are intentional renames or crosswalks.",
    "All other mappings are classified as typo_or_format.",
    "Applied to expenditures, revenues and capital alike."
  ],
  "_status": "draft-needs-budget-office-review",

  "_ruleTypes": {
    "_comment": [
      "Only deliberate renames and organizational crosswalks belong here.",
      "Every other exact mapping below defaults to typo_or_format.",
      "A deliberate rename is the same entity under a new official name.",
      "A crosswalk groups distinct source labels only for comparison."
    ],
    "service": {
      "Human Resources and Development": "deliberate_rename",
      "Human Resource Development": "deliberate_rename",
      "Community Maintenance and Development": "deliberate_rename"
    },
    "department_name": {
